 50	
 51	
 52	    /**
 53	     * A simulator constructor to set the CREATION_PROBABILITY of each actor.
 54	     * This constructor can be used to test different combinations of probabilities to find an optimal combination
 55	     *
 56	     * @param GrassProbability Probability of Grass being generated
 57	     * @param DeerProbability Probability of Deer being generated
 58	     * @param CoyoteProbability Probability of Coyote being generated
 59	     * @param WolfProbability Probability of Wolf being generated
